.TH mnnn-org-resource-add 1  "mnnn-org-resource-add 2.22.3" 
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH NAME
mnnn\-org\-resource\-add \- Give the org one of your things here (the original stays as it is)
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBmnnn org resource add\fR [\fB\-\-create\fR] [\fB\-\-home\fR] [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-description\fR] [\fB\-\-lang\fR] [\fB\-\-non\-interactive\fR] [\fB\-\-code\-from\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR]... [\fB\-\-log\-file\fR] [\fB\-\-space\-kind\fR] [\fB\-\-main\fR] [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-\-format\fR] [\fB\-y\fR|\fB\-\-yes\fR] [\fB\-\-query\fR] [\fB\-\-theme\-mode\fR] [\fB\-\-transport\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIORG\fR> <\fIKIND\fR> <\fINAME\fR> 
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH DESCRIPTION
Give the org one of your things here (the original stays as it is)
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-create\fR
Create the thing first, then add it
.TP
\fB\-\-home\fR \fI<DIR>\fR
Muninn home directory (default ~/.muninn)
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_HOME\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Database file (default <home>/storage/muninn.database)
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_DB\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-description\fR \fI<DESCRIPTION>\fR [default: ]

.TP
\fB\-\-lang\fR \fI<LANG>\fR
Code language when creating code (default math)
.TP
\fB\-\-non\-interactive\fR
Never prompt; missing values are errors
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_NON_INTERACTIVE\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-code\-from\fR \fI<CODE>\fR
Code: copy from an existing code or built\-in (`csv`, `template:ingest\-connector`, …)
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
More output (repeatable)
.TP
\fB\-\-log\-file\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Write logs to this file instead of stderr (the TUI defaults to <home>/logs/tui.log)
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_LOG_FILE\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-space\-kind\fR \fI<SPACE_KIND>\fR
Code space kind when creating a space (default analysis)
.TP
\fB\-\-main\fR \fI<MAIN>\fR
Code space main (existing code). Without it a `{name}\-main` code is created
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Print nothing but errors and requested data
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_QUIET\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-format\fR \fI<FORMAT>\fR
Journal format when creating a journal (markdown or latex)
.TP
\fB\-y\fR, \fB\-\-yes\fR
Answer yes to every confirmation
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_YES\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-query\fR \fI<QUERY>\fR
Live search query when creating a search
.TP
\fB\-\-theme\-mode\fR \fI<THEME_MODE>\fR
Override the theme mode for this run
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
light
.IP \(bu 2
dark
.IP \(bu 2
system
.RE
.RS
May also be specified with the \fBMUNINN_THEME_MODE\fR environment variable. 
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-transport\fR \fI<stream|poll>\fR
How live collaboration reaches peers: `stream` (gRPC streams, the default) or `poll` (requests over the peer connection; for containers). Overrides MUNINN_COLLAB_TRANSPORT and the `net config \-\-collab\-transport` setting
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIORG\fR>

.TP
<\fIKIND\fR>
model, search, journal, project, report, code or space
.TP
<\fINAME\fR>

.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH VERSION
v2.22.3
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBmnnn\fR(1)
